  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility Study - Poland: FEED Study, through Westinghouse Electric Company LLC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USTDA is funding a Feasibility Study for special purpose vehicle PGE EJ 1 spka z ograniczon odpowiedzialnoci for the development of a Front End Engineering Design (FEED) Study. The objective of the FEED Study is to facilitate the development of the first and second civil nuclear power plants in Poland.</narrative>
  </description>
